Subject: [PATCH 0804/3799] soh: rename func_80B864EC ->
 ItemOcarina_FlyInCutscene

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: flight action for the params-1 cutscene spawn: spins the ocarina on X and Y while gravity is applied, and at cutscene frame 220 repositions and relaunches it. The cutscene-frame check is what ties it to the cutscene.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Ocarina/z_item_ocarina.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Ocarina/z_item_ocarina.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Ocarina/z_item_ocarina.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Ocarina/z_item_ocarina.c
index db1b4c3f6..84a4cb4c6 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Ocarina/z_item_ocarina.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Item_Ocarina/z_item_ocarina.c
@@ -20,7 +20,8 @@ void ItemOcarina_GetThrown(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play);
 void ItemOcarina_Fly(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play);
 void ItemOcarina_WaitInWater(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play);
 void ItemOcarina_StartSoTCutscene(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play);
-void func_80B864EC(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B864EC: flight action for the params-1 cutscene spawn: spins the ocarina on X and Y while gravity is applied, and at cutscene frame 220 repositions and relaunches it. The cutscene-frame check is what ties it to the cutscene.
+void ItemOcarina_FlyInCutscene(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80B864EC [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B865E0: the params-1 spawn's first action: sets the launch velocity and gravity, then hands off to the flight action. Mirrors the params-0 pair ItemOcarina_GetThrown -> ItemOcarina_Fly, but for the cutscene-driven spawn.
 void ItemOcarina_GetThrownInCutscene(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80B865E0 [LLM:HIGH]
 void ItemOcarina_DoNothing(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play);
@@ -134,7 +135,7 @@ void ItemOcarina_GetThrown(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play) {
     ItemOcarina_SetupAction(this, ItemOcarina_Fly);
 }
 
-void func_80B864EC(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play) {
+void ItemOcarina_FlyInCutscene(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play) {
     Actor_UpdatePos(&this->actor);
     this->actor.shape.rot.x += this->spinRotOffset * 2;
     this->actor.shape.rot.y += this->spinRotOffset * 3;
@@ -165,7 +166,7 @@ void ItemOcarina_GetThrownInCutscene(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->actor.velocity.x = 0.0f;
     this->actor.velocity.y = 4.0f;
     this->actor.velocity.z = 6.0f;
-    ItemOcarina_SetupAction(this, func_80B864EC);
+    ItemOcarina_SetupAction(this, ItemOcarina_FlyInCutscene);  // was func_80B864EC [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void ItemOcarina_DoNothing(ItemOcarina* this, PlayState* play) {
